Dear Dr. Matzke,

Not sure if this has been resolved but I am experiencing the same issue.

I was able to produce the plots from the example script but run into this error message when I try to produce plots with some other data.

I made sure that the "scriptdir" refers to an actual directory on my machine, and that the file "plot_phylo3_nodecoords.R" is in there. (Probably why the example script worked fine from model run to creating plots). Just not sure why I still run into this.

Looking forward to your kind response. Thank you.

-Vhon

