5)      Then ran into an error:

Error: Failed to install 'BioGeoBEARS' from GitHub:

  Failed to install 'rexpokit' from GitHub:

  (converted from warning) installation of package ‘C:/Users/s4556580/AppData/Local/Temp/RtmpYtfZbS/file11698b214574/rexpokit_0.26.6.4.tar.gz’ had non-zero exit status

Before doing all this – when I first installed BioGeoBEARS – I selected “3” and it continued with the installation. Not sure what’s happening when it’s updating or with the “non-zero exit status”

Looking forward to your kind response. Thank you!

-Vhon

